>> title: Thumbprint Cookies
>> category: Cookies
>> tags: jam, pecans, butter, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: jam thumbprints, thumbprint, jam drops, birds nest cookies
>> servings: 24
>> time: 45 min

Heat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C) and line two #baking sheets{} with parchment.

Cream @unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(113 g; softened) with @light brown sugar{1/4%cup}(55 g).

>> step: beat in
Beat @egg yolk{1}(18 g) and @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL) into @&(~1)creamed butter{}.

Whisk @all-purpose flour{1%cup}(125 g) and @table salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g).

Stir @&(~1)dry ingredients{} into @&(~2)batter{}.

>> step: coat in egg white and pecans, press a well, bake 350°F (175°C) 12 min
Roll @&(~1)dough{} into balls, coat in @egg white{1%large}(30 g; lightly beaten) then @finely chopped pecans{3/4%cup}(85 g), press a well in each, and bake at 350°F for ~{12%min}.

>> step: fill with jam
Fill @&(~1)cookies{} with @raspberry jam{1/3%cup}(100 g).
